{"id":"wb-8-202","name":"涞水龙严寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"涞水龙严寺塔","text":"涞水龙严寺塔位于河北省保定市涞水县城北偏西11公里的中水东村西，清水河东岸，俗称水东塔。该塔相传为镇山洪所修。被中华人民共和国国务院列入第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B6%9E%E6%B0%B4%E9%BE%99%E4%B8%A5%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":88745785,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88745785","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}